WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.563 --> 00:00:02.450
This is AssetPulse:

2
00:00:02.545 --> 00:00:05.244
a real-time demo for keeping IV pumps

3
00:00:05.244 --> 00:00:06.904
where a hospital needs them.

4
00:00:08.153 --> 00:00:10.533
All day, nurses move pumps from the

5
00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.579
clean utility room into patient rooms,

6
00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:16.662
and the clean shelf quietly runs low.

7
00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:21.108
AssetPulse catches that the moment it happens,

8
00:00:21.108 --> 00:00:24.124
and pages a technician automatically.

9
00:00:25.364 --> 00:00:27.824
A TypeScript server holds the floor's state

10
00:00:27.824 --> 00:00:31.280
and streams every change over WebSockets.

11
00:00:31.282 --> 00:00:33.503
The control panel is React.

12
00:00:33.503 --> 00:00:35.923
Every event lands in Snowflake,

13
00:00:35.923 --> 00:00:37.836
and it all runs on Azure.

14
00:00:39.075 --> 00:00:40.711
And that phone isn't a mock-up or

15
00:00:40.711 --> 00:00:43.410
an emulator. It's the real tech app,

16
00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.977
built with Expo and React Native,

17
00:00:45.977 --> 00:00:47.626
compiled for the web,

18
00:00:47.626 --> 00:00:49.871
and running live on its own connection.

19
00:00:50.904 --> 00:00:51.901
Here's the loop.

20
00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:55.026
Drag three pumps off the clean shelf

21
00:00:55.026 --> 00:00:56.952
and into patient rooms.

22
00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.506
The shelf hits its minimum,

23
00:00:59.506 --> 00:01:01.101
a work order opens,

24
00:01:01.101 --> 00:01:03.745
and Joe's phone buzzes with a notification.

25
00:01:04.242 --> 00:01:05.120
He taps it,

26
00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.317
accepts the order,

27
00:01:06.317 --> 00:01:09.654
restocks, and marks three pumps delivered.

28
00:01:09.654 --> 00:01:12.365
The shelf refills instantly.

29
00:01:16.282 --> 00:01:19.407
Insights shows how quickly Joe responded.

30
00:01:19.407 --> 00:01:22.476
And you can ask Snowflake Cortex in plain English.

31
00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:28.816
How many pumps were delivered? Three.

32
00:01:30.401 --> 00:01:33.497
It's live at assetpulse.proswitch.ai

33
00:01:34.751 --> 00:01:36.092
Try it yourself.
